BS_:

BU_: BMW_I3

CM_ "Draft DBC derived from BMW i3 FlexRay and PT-CAN logs. Address 27 was not observed in any uploaded segment. Signals below intentionally mix three classes: confirmed parse signals already used by CarState, state/proxy helpers useful for reverse engineering, and unresolved TX candidates kept for shadow-debug correlation.";

BO_ 49 STEER_TORQUE: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_CYCLE_RAW : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_B : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_C : 40|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_D : 56|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ DRIVER_STEER_TORQUE_BMW : 24|12@1+ (0.005,-10) [-10|10.475] "Nm" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_STATUS_RAW : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 CM_ BO_ 49 "Confirmed steering-torque helper. BMW-style driver torque lives in the 24|12 field and is valid on the cycle-0 subframe. CarState uses this path for steeringTorque/steeringPressed.";

BO_ 51 EPS_ANGLE: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_ANGLE_CYCLE_RAW : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_ANGLE_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_ANGLE_RAW_WORD_B : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_ANGLE_RAW_WORD_C : 40|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_ANGLE_RAW_WORD_D : 56|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ EPS_STEERING_ANGLE_BMW : 24|16@1+ (0.0439453125,-1440) [-1440|1440] "deg" BMW_I3
 CM_ BO_ 51 "BMW SP2018-style EPS angle frame aligned to dynm reference work. The m0/cycle-0 subframe carries the steering angle on bytes 3:4 using angle_deg = raw * 0.0439453125 - 1440.0.";
 CM_ SG_ 51 EPS_STEERING_ANGLE_BMW "Primary FlexRay EPS steering-angle candidate aligned to dynm BMW SP2018 reference: steering_angle m0 : 24|16@1+ (0.0439453125,-1440).";

BO_ 55 VEHICLE_SPEED_PROV: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_CYCLE_RAW M : 0|2@1+ (1,0) [0|3] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_RAW_WORD_B : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_RAW_WORD_C : 40|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_RAW_WORD_D : 56|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LONG_ACCEL_RAW m0 : 24|16@1+ (0.002,-65) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ VEHICLE_SPEED_BMW m3 : 24|16@1+ (0.015625,0) [0|65535] "kph" BMW_I3
 SG_ DRIVING_STATUS_BMW m3 : 44|2@1+ (1,0) [0|7] "" BMW_I3
CM_ BO_ 55 "Confirmed primary vehicle-speed source aligned with the BMW SP2018 multiplexed layout. CarState consumes the m3 vehicle-speed subframe directly for runtime vehicle speed.";

BO_ 56 DYNAMICS_YAW_PROV: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ DYNAMICS_YAW_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
