CM_ BO_ 131 "Primary longitudinal state/gate helper. Legacy routes and the current three-way comparison set 000003ff (manual), 00000400 (ACC-only), and 00000402 (ACC+TJA) confirm that 131 separates manual-driving families from ACC/TJA session families, but does not by itself cleanly split ACC-only from TJA. Manual families still sit in the older ...9883/ba83/b98302ffff space, while both ACC-only and TJA move into the newer ...00000effff / ...7c-7f8002ffff family. Treat 131 as the coarse ACC/TJA family gate, not the final TJA discriminator.";

