CM_ BO_ 135 "Primary longitudinal/lateral session-state helper, but no longer a single rigid TJA gate. Historical labeling from 000003ff/00000400/00000402 still holds for the older families: manual -> ...22e0e188a205, ACC-only -> ...2228e260a205, older TJA -> ...2228e2604206 / ...20e0e2403206. Newer realdata route 00000006--e6a3e58043 shows additional valid managed-TJA families that do not fit the old 4206-only rule, especially ...20e0e240e201, ...2228e260e201, ...2228e2608202, and ...2228e2408202. Use 135 together with the 60->72 burst behavior when classifying stock lateral context; 135 alone is no longer sufficient to declare ACC-only vs TJA on newer routes.";

